Restaurant SaaS ERP & Sales Growth Platform — Complete System Design
What you are describing is more than a restaurant POS system. It is a Restaurant Sales, Operations, Inventory, Staff Commission, and Business Intelligence Management Platform.

The main objective should be to help restaurants:
1. Increase sales through professional online ordering, customer portals, waiter referrals, promotions, and repeat customers.
2. Manage daily operations through waiters, receptionists, cashiers, and kitchen staff.
3. Control stock and costs by connecting purchases, inventory, recipes, sales, and wastage.
4. Manage employees including salaries, advances, commissions, and waiter performance.
5. Understand profitability through accurate financial reports and business intelligence.
6. Operate independently through a SaaS architecture where every restaurant has its own account, settings, users, menu, customer portal, and business data.
I recommend designing it as one integrated platform with different interfaces for different users, rather than developing five independent applications.
